{"id":"normalmente","lemma":"normalmente","pos":"adv","rank":1199,"glosses":["normally; usually; most of the time; customarily"],"ipa":"/noɾˈmalˌmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-normalmente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Almuerzo ahí normalmente.","en":"I generally have lunch there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707306","words":[{"g":"lunch"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Normalmente desayuno aquí.","en":"I usually have breakfast here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707489","words":[null,{"g":"breakfast"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"¿Normalmente llegas temprano o tarde?","en":"Are you usually early or late?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460022","words":[null,{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"early, early on"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"late"}]},{"text":"Normalmente estoy de acuerdo con ella.","en":"I usually agree with her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39123","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null,{"g":"she"}],"phrases":[[2,5,"according to"]]},{"text":"Normalmente voy andando a la escuela.","en":"Usually I go to school on foot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1153026","words":[null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to walk, to go","l":"andar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"school"}]}]}